error[method-overwrite]: `area(::Any)` defined twice; later definition replaces earlier one
 --> src/MethodOverwritePositive.jl:5:1
  |
4 | area(side; scale = 1) = scale * side^2
  | ---- positional calls never reach this body
5 | area(side; units = :m) = side^2
  | ^^^^ replaces earlier method
  |
  = why: keywords take no part in dispatch, and package with overwrite cannot precompile
  = fix: merge bodies into one method, or give methods different argument types   [manual]
  = docs: corset explain method-overwrite
  = note: deny from correctness group, library preset
  = note: opt out with `# corset: allow method-overwrite -- <reason>`

